msgid ""
"This is a highly experimental program. ETS2LA is not perfect, and you will "
"find issues with it's driving and safety. <span class=\"text-text-accent "
"font-bold\">Do not leave ETS2LA unattended, especially in multiplayer.</span>"
msgstr ""
"这是一个高度实验性的程序。ETS2LA 并不完美，您可能会遇到驾驶和安全方面的问题。"
"<span class=\"text-text-accent font-bold\">请勿在无人看管的情况下运行 "
"ETS2LA，尤其是在多人游戏中。</span>"

msgid "Error in traffic update loop."
msgstr "交通更新时发生错误。"

msgid ""
"Translate news articles to your selected display language. This may take a "
"while depending on the number of articles and your internet connection."
msgstr ""
"将新闻文章翻译为您选择的显示语言。根据文章数量和您的网络连接情况，此过程可能"
"需要一些时间。"

msgid "Slow"
msgstr "慢"

msgid ""
"When enabled, the overlay will toggle between interaction and non-"
"interaction mode when you press it's keybind. When disabled, the overlay "
"will only be interactive while you hold down the keybind."
msgstr ""
"启用后，按下对应按键时，叠加层将在交互和非交互模式之间切换。禁用后，只有在按"
"住对应按键时，叠加层才会处于交互状态。"

msgid ""
"Decreases the current target speed by one step. If speed control and lane "
"assist are off, this key acts like SET. Meaning it will set the current "
"speed to speedlimit."
msgstr ""
"将当前目标速度降低一个档位。如果速度控制和车道辅助均已关闭，此按键的作用类似"
"于“SET”，即将当前速度设为限速值。"

